description:
Success Point Academy provides the best quality coaching platform built on the Knowledge, Teaching Passion and Principles of the founder - Prof. Parag Nar;
Success Point Academy is a Professionally Managed yet very Passionately driven coaching class for ICSE, CBSE, IGCSE, IBDP, SSC & HSC Board Exams, as well as Engineering & Medical Entrance Exams like JEE Main & Advanced , AIIMS, AIPMT and CET.
At Success Point Academy, we have been coaching medical and engineering aspirants since 2013. We work closely with our students during Std. XI & XII, motivating them to put in daily and consistent efforts.
